अघायुरिन्द्रियारामो मोघं पार्थ स जीवति ॥ १६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1075,\"bb\":959,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/16/b959/\",\"body_value\":\"evaṁ pravartitaṁ cakraṁ
nānuvartayatīha yaḥ
