moghaṁ pārtha sa jīvati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1076,\"bb\":960,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/16/b960/\",\"shadow_value\":\"evam – thus; pravartitam – established by the Vedas; cakram – cycle; na – does not; anuvartayati – adopt; iha – in this life; yaḥ – one who; agha-āyuḥ – whose life is full of sins; indriya-ārāmaḥ – satisfied in sense gratification; mogham – uselessly; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā (Arjuna); saḥ – he; jīvati – lives.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"evam\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"pravartitam\",\"translation\":\"established by the Vedas\"},{\"word\":\"cakram\",\"translation\":\"cycle\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"does not\"},{\"word\":\"anuvartayati\",\"translation\":\"adopt\"},{\"word\":\"iha\",\"translation\":\"in this life\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"one who\"},{\"word\":\"agha-āyuḥ\",\"translation\":\"whose life is full of sins\"},{\"word\":\"indriya-ārāmaḥ\",\"translation\":\"satisfied in sense gratification\"},{\"word\":\"mogham\",\"translation\":\"uselessly\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā (Arjuna)\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"jīvati\",\"translation\":\"lives\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1077,\"bb\":961,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/16/b961/\",\"body_value\":\"My dear Arjuna, one who does not follow in human life the cycle of sacrifice thus established by the Vedas certainly leads a life full of sin. Living only for the satisfaction of the senses, such a person lives in vain.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1078,\"bb\":962,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/16/b962/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\